# Interactive UI QA

If the user asks for **browser QA**, **UI QA**, **role QA**, **absolute baseline**,
**full characterization**, or **delta / regression retest** against CuratorX:

1. Read and follow [`.cursor/skills/interactive-ui-qa/SKILL.md`](../skills/interactive-ui-qa/SKILL.md).
2. Execute **only** authored IDs in
   [`.cursor/skills/interactive-ui-qa/reference.md`](../skills/interactive-ui-qa/reference.md).
3. Target maintainer QA **`http://10.10.1.202:8790`** +
   `/Volumes/appdata/curatorx-qa-scripts/.env.qa` — **never** production **`:8788`**.
4. Write artifacts under `/Volumes/appdata/curatorx-qa-scripts/qa-runs/`.
5. Verdict **FAIL** if any `blocker` / `major` remains open.

Do not invent pathways. New UI → update `reference.md`.
